        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Main-Image-2-Edward-Smiling-Finding-Treasure.png?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Did you know that microtransactions make games more fun? That might seem like a dubious statement, but it was one Ubisoft was more than happy to put its name to last year. However, it appears the company might have learned a lesson from the pushback it subsequently endured across the internet: as complaints around the newly released Assassin's Creed Black Flag Resynced's microtransactions make headlines, it's been noticed Ubisoft's widely mocked \"more fun\" sentiment is conspicuously absent from its latest financial report.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/ubisoft-microtransactions-fun-claim-black-flag-resynced\">Read more</a></p>",
